WEBVTT

00:14:26.963 --> 00:14:31.232
I look forward to the day
that I can sit beside you, easel-side,

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:35.905
watching the world that we can create
with our new toolboxes

00:14:35.929 --> 00:14:38.975
and the discoveries
that we can make about ourselves.

00:14:40.492 --> 00:14:41.699
Thank you.

00:14:41.723 --> 00:14:43.523
(Applause)